@startuml MiniPay - Payment Authorization Sequence
!theme blueprint
title MiniPay — Secventa: Autorizare Plata (Happy Path)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam noteBorderColor #F39C12
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEF9E7

actor "Merchant" as M
participant "gateway-svc\n:8084" as GW #E8F4FD
participant "vault-svc\n:8085" as VLT #E8F4FD
participant "fraud-svc\n:8090\n(Python)" as FRD #FDEDEC
participant "network-svc\n:8086" as NET #E8F4FD
participant "issuer-svc\n:8087" as ISS #E8F4FD
participant "MiniDS\n:8301" as MDS #FEF9E7
database "PostgreSQL" as PG #FEF9E7
queue "Kafka\npayment-events" as KFK #FDEDEC
participant "audit-svc\n:8091" as AUD #E8F4FD
participant "notif-svc\n:8093" as NOT #E8F4FD

== Initiere ==

M -> GW : POST /v1/payments/authorize\n{ pan, expiryDate, amount, currency, merchantId }
activate GW
note right of GW : JWT validat\nBearer token OAuth2

== Step 1: Tokenizare PAN ==

GW -> VLT : POST /vault/tokenize\n{ pan, expiryDate }
activate VLT
VLT -> MDS : store { dpan, encPan(AES-256-GCM), bin }
activate MDS
MDS --> VLT : 200 OK
deactivate MDS
VLT --> GW : { dpan: "411111XXXXX1234" }
deactivate VLT
note right of VLT : PAN original NICIODATA\npastreaza in gateway

== Step 2: Fraud Scoring ==

GW -> FRD : POST /fraud/score\n{ dpan, amount, currency, merchantId, ipAddress }
activate FRD
FRD -> FRD : XGBoost.predict(features)\n+ SHAP.TreeExplainer
FRD --> GW : { score: 0.12, decision: "ALLOW",\nreasons: [...] }
deactivate FRD

alt score >= 0.8 (HIGH RISK)
  GW --> M : 200 { status: BLOCKED,\nfraudScore: 0.87,\nreasons: [SHAP explanations] }
  note right : GDPR Art.22\nexplicatie furnizata
else score >= 0.5 (MEDIUM RISK)
  GW --> M : 200 { status: CHALLENGE,\nacsTransId: "uuid" }
  note right : Merchant redirecteaza\nla 3DS2 OTP flow
else score < 0.5 (LOW RISK — Happy Path)

== Step 3: Autorizare Retea ==

  GW -> NET : POST /network/authorize\n{ dpan, expiryDate, amount, currency, txnId }
  activate NET

  NET -> VLT : POST /vault/detokenize/{dpan}
  activate VLT
  VLT -> MDS : get encPan by dpan
  activate MDS
  MDS --> VLT : { encPan }
  deactivate MDS
  VLT --> NET : { pan: "4111111111111111" }
  deactivate VLT

  NET -> ISS : POST /issuer/authorize\n{ pan, expiryDate, amount, currency }
  activate ISS
  ISS -> PG : SELECT card WHERE pan=?\nCHECK status, balance, dailyLimit
  activate PG
  PG --> ISS : CardAccount { status:ACTIVE,\nbalance:500000, dailySpent:0 }
  deactivate PG
  ISS -> PG : UPDATE balance -= amount\nUPDATE dailySpent += amount
  ISS --> NET : { responseCode: "00",\nauthCode: "DEA161" }
  deactivate ISS

  NET --> GW : { isApproved: true,\nresponseCode: "00", authCode: "DEA161" }
  deactivate NET

== Step 4: Publish Events (async) ==

  GW ->> KFK : PaymentAuditEvent\n{ txnId, status:AUTHORIZED,\namount, fraudScore }
  note right : Fire-and-forget\nNu blocheaza raspunsul

  KFK ->> AUD : consume event
  activate AUD
  AUD -> PG : INSERT audit_entry\n{ seq++, entryHash=SHA256(...+prevHash) }
  deactivate AUD

  KFK ->> NOT : consume event
  activate NOT
  NOT -> NOT : generate EMAIL notification
  deactivate NOT

== Raspuns Final ==

  GW --> M : 200 OK\n{\n  txnId: "550e8400-...",\n  status: "AUTHORIZED",\n  isoResponseCode: "00",\n  authCode: "DEA161",\n  fraudScore: 0.12,\n  amount: 15000,\n  currency: "RON",\n  timestamp: "2026-05-11T14:30:00Z"\n}

end

deactivate GW

note over M, NOT : Timp total (happy path): ~180ms\nTokenizare: ~20ms | Fraud: ~40ms | Network: ~80ms | Kafka: async

@enduml
